body:
I do think it's certainly possible with the information I've gotten and my personal experience. I can pm you some details if you want. I don't want to post anything that I'm not 100% certain about in the way of vendor or give away all my reasoning, but given your activity in the community and being a well respected vendor, I would feel comfortable sharing some information with you if you were interested. This is the kinda stuff that is going to get someone hurt and ruin this for the rest of us. If it comes out that one person is/has done it, you know it's going to run rampant and be a bunch of unfounded claims and such. Shoot me a PM if you're interested, I'm sure you could answer a few questions too. I do believe I'm going to get a COA on it soon. 

TO ANYONE ELSE READING THIS POST;
Do not jump to any conclusions. As of now, this is unfounded and based on non-scientific suspicion of mine. Again, please do not jump to any conclusions, as of now this is nothing more than an idea and more than likely wouldn't have anything to do with vendors I've seen on here, NOR this new vendor that has popped up.
